Game data extracted from Stellaris

The files under plugin/data/ include facts extracted from a local installation of
Stellaris (Cygnus v4.5.2):

  * advisor_sounds.json  -- the set of advisor sound names reachable by the
                            default advisor voice group, parsed from
                            sound/soundeffects.asset
  * on_action_hooks.json -- on_action names, source file and line, scope, and the
                            event type vanilla uses on each hook, audited from
                            common/on_actions/ and events/

These are lists of identifiers and derived metadata, not game assets. No audio,
texture, or localisation content from Stellaris is redistributed.

